%main.attributions-page
  %h2 Attributions
  %p.attributions-intro
    Ethnic LA is built on the work of photographers, mapmakers, and public agencies who share what they make.
    Thank you to all of them.

  %section
    %h3 Data and maps
    .data-credits
      .data-credit
        %h4 Language Map
        %p
          = link_to('English Learners by Grade & Language', 'https://www.cde.ca.gov/ds/ad/fileselsch.asp', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
          from the California Department of Education, with school locations from
          = succeed('.') do
            = link_to('California Public Schools', 'https://gis.data.ca.gov/search?q=california%20public%20schools', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
      .data-credit
        %h4 Ethnicity Map
        %p
          = link_to('2020 Census Detailed DHC-A', 'https://www.census.gov/data/tables/2023/dec/2020-census-detailed-dhc-a.html', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
          from the U.S. Census Bureau, with census tract locations from the
          = succeed('.') do
            = link_to('Census Gazetteer Files', 'https://www.census.gov/geographies/reference-files/time-series/geo/gazetteer-files.html', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
      .data-credit
        %h4 Map outlines
        %p
          County and coastline outlines on the small maps from the California Department of Technology's
          = succeed('.') do
            = link_to('county boundaries', 'https://gis.data.ca.gov/datasets/CDT::california-county-boundaries-and-identifiers', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
      .data-credit
        %h4 Base maps and addresses
        %p
          Map tiles by
          = link_to('Mapbox', 'https://www.mapbox.com/about/maps/', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
          with data ©
          = succeed('.') do
            = link_to('OpenStreetMap contributors', 'https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')
          Addresses located with the
          = succeed('.') do
            = link_to('U.S. Census Geocoder', 'https://geocoding.geo.census.gov/', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener')

  %section
    %h3 Language photos
    %p.section-intro The photos behind each language on the home page, and where they come from.
    .photo-credits
      - @photo_credits.each do |credit|
        .photo-credit
          = image_tag(credit[:image], alt: '', loading: 'lazy', class: 'photo-credit-image')
          .photo-credit-text
            %span.photo-credit-language= credit[:language]
            = link_to(credit[:url], class: 'photo-credit-source', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', title: credit[:url]) do
              = credit[:source]
              %span{ aria: { hidden: 'true' } } ↗︎
